          "explanation": "Doctor corrected the family-facing urgency misconception in non-catastrophic language.",
          "quote": "不是今天不治明天就没命的急症，但也不能拖回家等门诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00363",
          "explanation": "Doctor explained why final certainty still requires pathology while action cannot wait indefinitely.",
          "quote": "最终是什么、严不严重，要等切下来做病理"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by uncertainty over whether a likely benign tumor could wait. The doctor clearly explained that the suspected diagnosis was not final pathology, but the location, symptoms, and hydrocephalus risk made home waiting inappropriate.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01012",
          "explanation": "Doctor assigned unresolved postoperative/follow-up decisions to specific owners and required written handoff.",
          "quote": "神外主刀/管床是谁"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01012",
          "explanation": "Doctor linked follow-up MRI and pathology to the neurosurgical pathway.",
          "quote": "病理结果出来后谁通知您"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by repeated risk of responsibility gaps across neurosurgery, rehabilitation, pathology, MRI, NG/swallowing, and medications. The doctor repaired this by specifying what must be written, who owns it, and when family should not accept discharge/transition without it.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00117",
          "explanation": "Doctor changed the plan when morning headache worsened, escalating from planned outpatient navigation to emergency assessment.",
          "quote": "请您把目的地从\"门诊/病房护士站\"改成急诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00117",
          "explanation": "Doctor explained why the new symptom changed priority.",
          "quote": "孩子本来就有中后颅窝占位和脑积水"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered when the caregiver reported worse morning headache. The doctor explicitly reprioritized from document/clinic workflow to ED CT and neurosurgical evaluation, changing the trajectory to urgent in-person care.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
